<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>
    <ThingDef ParentName="BaseMeleeWeapon_Sharp_Quality">
        <techLevel>Spacer</techLevel>
        <weaponClasses>
            <li>Melee</li>
        </weaponClasses>
        <graphicData>
            <shaderType>Cutout</shaderType>
            <texPath>Things/Weapons/SisterOfSilence/SisterOfSilence_Sword</texPath>
            <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
            <drawSize>1.0</drawSize>
        </graphicData>
        <defName>BEWH_ExecutionerGreatblade</defName>
        <label>Executioner Greatblade</label>
        <description>A two-handed power sword wielded by Sisters of Silence. Edged with special silica glass, as hard as diamond, it can deliver a deadly blow to an armored foe with the right technique. \n\nA certain Execution Blade, named "Veracity", was once wielded by the Emperor of Mankind Himself, but was passed down to Knight-Commander Jenetia Krole some time before the Horus Heresy. She was an exceptionally powerful Blank - so much so that combined with the Onyx Cloak she wore, she was nearly invisible to daemons and normal humans alike.\n\nForged to slay witches and daemons, its blows strike hardest against those touched by the Warp, dealing more damage the higher the target's psychic sensitivity.</description>
        <uiIconScale>1.0</uiIconScale>
        <statBases>
            <WorkToMake>55000</WorkToMake>
            <Mass>3</Mass>
            <MarketValue>4800</MarketValue>
        </statBases>
        <equippedAngleOffset>-40</equippedAngleOffset>
        <tools>
            <li>
                <label>handle</label>
                <capacities>
                    <li>Blunt</li>
                </capacities>
                <power>16</power>
                <cooldownTime>1.8</cooldownTime>
            </li>
            <li>
                <label>point</label>
                <capacities>
                    <li>Stab</li>
                </capacities>
                <power>28</power>
                <cooldownTime>2.2</cooldownTime>
                <armorPenetration>1.2</armorPenetration>
            </li>
            <li>
                <label>edge</label>
                <capacities>
                    <li>Cut</li>
                </capacities>
                <power>32</power>
                <cooldownTime>2.6</cooldownTime>
                <armorPenetration>1.2</armorPenetration>
            </li>
        </tools>
        <recipeMaker>
            <unfinishedThingDef>UnfinishedWeapon</unfinishedThingDef>
            <skillRequirements>
                <Crafting>14</Crafting>
            </skillRequirements>
            <recipeUsers Inherit="false">
                <li>FabricationBench</li>
            </recipeUsers>
            <displayPriority>445</displayPriority>
            <researchPrerequisites Inherit="False">
                <li>BEWH_SilentSisterhood</li>
            </researchPrerequisites>
        </recipeMaker>
        <weaponTags>
            <li>BEWH_CustodianWeapon</li>
        </weaponTags>
        <stuffCategories IsNull="True" />
        <thingSetMakerTags Inherit="False" />
        <modExtensions>
            <li Class="Core40k.DefModExtension_StatDamageScaling">
                <scalings>
                    <li>
                        <stat>PsychicSensitivity</stat>
                        <source>Target</source>
                        <baseline>1</baseline>
                        <perPoint>0.5</perPoint>
                    </li>
                </scalings>
                <minFactor>1</minFactor>
                <maxFactor>2</maxFactor>
            </li>
        </modExtensions>
        <costList>
            <Plasteel>110</Plasteel>
            <Gold>15</Gold>
            <ComponentSpacer>3</ComponentSpacer>
        </costList>
    </ThingDef>

    <ThingDef ParentName="BaseHumanMakeableGun">
        <graphicData>
            <texPath>Things/Weapons/SisterOfSilence/SisterOfSilence_Bolter</texPath>
            <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
            <shaderType>Cutout</shaderType>
            <drawSize>1.0</drawSize>
        </graphicData>
        <soundInteract>Interact_Rifle</soundInteract>
        <techLevel>Spacer</techLevel>
        <weaponClasses>
            <li>RangedHeavy</li>
        </weaponClasses>
        <defName>BEWH_VratineBolter</defName>
        <label>Vratine Bolter</label>
        <description>An ancient and ornate boltgun design, used by the Sisters of Silence during the Horus Heresy. They could be found in the hands of Questora cadres of the Chamber of Judgement and Eradicators cadres of the Chamber of Vigilance. \n\nThe Silent Sisterhood were no slouches during the Age of Darkness, regularly being fielded against the legions of Chaos and the Traitor forces who followed them. Since all daemons are beings of the Warp and the Traitor sorcerors called upon the Immaterium for their powers, the Sisters were a very strong counter against them.\n\nIts sanctified bolts were made for hunting psykers and Warp-spawn, dealing more damage the higher the target's psychic sensitivity.</description>
        <uiIconScale>1.0</uiIconScale>
        <statBases>
            <WorkToMake>45000</WorkToMake>
            <Mass>5</Mass>
            <MarketValue>3800</MarketValue>
            <AccuracyTouch>0.55</AccuracyTouch>
            <AccuracyShort>0.64</AccuracyShort>
            <AccuracyMedium>0.55</AccuracyMedium>
            <AccuracyLong>0.45</AccuracyLong>
            <RangedWeapon_Cooldown>2.0</RangedWeapon_Cooldown>
        </statBases>
        <verbs>
            <li>
                <verbClass>Verb_Shoot</verbClass>
                <hasStandardCommand>true</hasStandardCommand>
                <defaultProjectile>BEWH_VratineBolterBolt</defaultProjectile>
                <warmupTime>1.5</warmupTime>
                <range>30.9</range>
                <ticksBetweenBurstShots>15</ticksBetweenBurstShots>
                <burstShotCount>3</burstShotCount>
                <soundCast>BEWH_CustodianBoltGunSound</soundCast>
                <soundCastTail>GunTail_Medium</soundCastTail>
                <muzzleFlashScale>11</muzzleFlashScale>
            </li>
        </verbs>
        <tools>
            <li>
                <label>stock</label>
                <capacities>
                    <li>Blunt</li>
                </capacities>
                <power>10</power>
                <cooldownTime>2.0</cooldownTime>
            </li>
            <li>
                <label>barrel</label>
                <capacities>
                    <li>Blunt</li>
                    <li>Poke</li>
                </capacities>
                <power>10</power>
                <cooldownTime>2.0</cooldownTime>
            </li>
        </tools>
        <recipeMaker>
            <unfinishedThingDef>UnfinishedWeapon</unfinishedThingDef>
            <skillRequirements>
                <Crafting>14</Crafting>
            </skillRequirements>
            <recipeUsers Inherit="false">
                <li>FabricationBench</li>
            </recipeUsers>
            <displayPriority>445</displayPriority>
            <researchPrerequisites Inherit="False">
                <li>BEWH_SilentSisterhood</li>
            </researchPrerequisites>
        </recipeMaker>
        <weaponTags>
            <li>BEWH_CustodianWeapon</li>
        </weaponTags>
        <stuffCategories IsNull="True" />
        <thingSetMakerTags Inherit="False" />
        <modExtensions>
            <li Class="Core40k.DefModExtension_StatDamageScaling">
                <scalings>
                    <li>
                        <stat>PsychicSensitivity</stat>
                        <source>Target</source>
                        <baseline>1</baseline>
                        <perPoint>0.5</perPoint>
                    </li>
                </scalings>
                <damageDefs>
                    <li>Bullet</li>
                </damageDefs>
                <minFactor>1</minFactor>
                <maxFactor>2</maxFactor>
            </li>
        </modExtensions>
        <costList>
            <Plasteel>100</Plasteel>
            <Steel>40</Steel>
            <Gold>10</Gold>
            <ComponentSpacer>3</ComponentSpacer>
        </costList>
    </ThingDef>

</Defs>
